  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T X.525 | ISO/IEC 9594-9 specifies a shadow service which Directory system agents (DSAs) may use to replicate Directory information. The service allows Directory information to be replicated among DSAs to improve service to Directory users, and provides for the automatic updating of this information.</abstract>
